    "sections": {
        "description": "Veloura Fashion Studio provides a structured website layout with configurable sections for featured collections, image galleries, testimonials, banners, contact information, and additional content. The theme includes built-in customization options for colours, typography, navigation menus, widget areas, headers, footers, and logo uploads through the Customizer. Homepage sections can be arranged without modifying the theme files, helping maintain an organised structure and consistent visual presentation across the website.The theme supports the block editor and integrates with commonly used page builders for flexible page creation. It is compatible with plugins for contact forms, search engine optimisation, caching, and security, allowing additional functionality while maintaining compatibility with current platform updates. Translation-ready files simplify multilingual website management, while standard coding practices support easier maintenance and long-term compatibility. Users can customise page spacing, content placement, image displays, banners, and widget areas using the available settings. Veloura Fashion Studio also includes configurable navigation, footer controls, social media integration, and gallery management that help organise website content while maintaining a clear and consistent appearance across all pages."
    },
